<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f5f7">
<title>访问验证 · Portfolio Admin</title>
<%- include('theme-boot') %>
<%- include('admin-style') %>
<style>
.unlock-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;width:100%;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--bg)}
.unlock-card{width:min(420px,100%);background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:38px}
.unlock-card .logo-mark{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:22px}
.unlock-card h1{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ink)}
.unlock-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 26px}
.unlock-card .btn{width:100%;height:42px}
.unlock-foot{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);line-height:1.7}
.unlock-foot code{background:var(--fill-3);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--ink-2)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="unlock-wrap">
  <div class="unlock-card">
    <div class="logo-mark">P</div>
    <h1>访问验证</h1>
    <p>这个后台的页面受访问密码保护。输入发布时生成的密码后即可继续浏览，浏览器会记住本次会话。</p>
    <form id="unlockForm" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="form-field">
        <label for="pw">访问密码</label>
        <input id="pw" type="password" placeholder="输入访问密码" autocomplete="current-password" required>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" id="go" type="submit">解锁并继续</button>
      <div class="form-msg" id="msg" hidden></div>
    </form>
    <div class="unlock-foot">用户名固定为 <code>admin</code>；密码只在服务端比对，不会写进页面或 URL。首页与状态页保持公开。</div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
var NEXT = <%- JSON.stringify(next) %>;
var form = document.getElementById('unlockForm');
var btn = document.getElementById('go');
var msg = document.getElementById('msg');
form.addEventListener('submit', async function (e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  btn.disabled = true;
  btn.textContent = '验证中…';
  msg.hidden = true;
  try {
    var r = await fetch('/api/unlock' + location.search, {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ password: document.getElementById('pw').value })
    });
    var j = await r.json();
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error(j.error || ('HTTP ' + r.status));
    location.href = NEXT;
  } catch (err) {
    msg.className = 'form-msg bad';
    msg.textContent = '解锁失败：' + err.message;
    msg.hidden = false;
    btn.disabled = false;
    btn.textContent = '解锁并继续';
  }
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
